[569.438824, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mSkill\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[572.530941, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli search \"Alloy Track whitepaper\" --in strings; echo; opticli search \"whitepaper\" ; echo; opticli search \"P\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[576.530941, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli where-used 1250 --pages; echo; opticli where-used 8 --pages; echo; opticli access 1251; echo; opticli tre\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[580.530941, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli versions 9 --limit 3; echo; opticli get 9 --fields MainContentArea; echo; opticli get 7 --fields MainCont\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[584.530941, "o", "\r\n  Two live pages promote the Alloy Track whitepaper, \"Whitepaper\" (page 8, `/en/alloy-track/download-whitepaper-alloy-track/`):\r\n"]
[584.531044, "o", "  \r\n  - **Alloy Track** (page 7, `/en/alloy-track/`) links straight to the Whitepaper page in its main content area. It hasn't changed since 2021.\r\n  - **Alloy Meet** (page 9, `/en/alloy-meet/`) shows it through the block \"Alloy Track whitepaper teaser\" (block 1250), which links to the Whitepaper page.\r\n    That went live today, in version 9_1710, published at 09:21 UTC by the `opticli` user.\r\n  \r\n"]
[584.531149, "o", "  **Partners section:** \"Partners\" (page 1251, `/en/partners/`) and its only child page, \"Partner training\" (page 1254), can be read by any signed-in visitor\r\n  (the Authenticated role). Visitors who aren't signed in can't see them. Administrators have full access. These rights are set directly on Partners and the\r\n  training page takes them over from it, so there's no narrower partner-only group.\r\n"]
[588.531149, "o", "\u001b[32m\u001b[1m/demo/Alloy\u001b[0m \u001b[36m❯\u001b[0m o"]
